From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: repatches <repatches@kimono.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:24:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mobile: Wear Kimono Photos' colours

The app's default theme, launcher icon background and splash screens use
Kimono Photos' palette and Kimono's paper ground instead of Immich's blue.

Must survive upstream changes:
- Default ("indigo") theme brand colours: light #482F74 (Photos deep),
  dark #E2DCF0 (Photos pale). Other presets the person picks are left alone.
- Launcher adaptive-icon background #f7f1e8; splash background #f7f1e8 light,
  #1c1618 dark (pre-12 bitmaps, Android 12+ styles, flutter_native_splash.yaml).
- The adaptive-icon foreground/monochrome vector drawables are deleted: the
  branding step ships PNG layers under drawable-nodpi with the same names.
  Artwork (icons, splash, logo, lockup) is copied in by
  apps/immich/branding/mobile/install.sh, not patched.

